.TH SPRITE_DRAW 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
sprite_draw \- Draw one frame of s with its top\-left corner at x,y (logical pixels), rotated by angle degrees clockwise about the frame's center, mirrored by flip
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.BI "void sprite_draw(const Sprite *s, int frame, float x, float y, double angle, Flip flip);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw one frame of s with its top\-left corner at x,y (logical pixels), rotated by angle degrees clockwise about the frame's center, mirrored by flip. Frames are drawn at their natural size. Under a camera, convert the position first with camera_to_screen(). Draw order is call order: draw the ground before the player and the player before the HUD.
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sprite_draw_scaled (3),
.BR sprite_draw_tinted (3),
.BR anim_frame (3),
.BR camera_to_screen (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
